<section class="hero">
  <span class="hero-eyebrow">Phil Venice · Supply chain risk &amp; decisions</span>
  <h1>What should we change<br>to reduce the risk?</h1>
  <p class="lede">Supply chain data should help us make a decision. I write about how to turn
    what we know into choices that protect production, preserve alternatives, and account
    for the time it takes to recover.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/blog/how-long-to-undo/">Read the first essay</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/about/">About Phil</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="prose introduction">
  <p class="section-label">The question behind the work</p>
  <h2>How long would it take to undo this decision?</h2>
  <p>A material specification, qualification requirement, or sourcing choice can commit
    a business to a dependency for years. I’m interested in how engineering, procurement,
    and operations can recognize those commitments while they still have choices.</p>
  <p>This is a place to develop that reasoning: what can change, who can change it,
    and whether the expected reduction in risk justifies the cost.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <p class="section-label">Writing</p>
  <div class="note-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <a class="note-item" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <div class="note-item-top">
        <span class="note-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="note-date">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
      {% if post.data.tags %}
      <div class="note-tags">
        {% for tag in post.data.tags %}<span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </a>
    {% else %}
    <a class="note-item" href="/blog/">
      <div class="note-item-top">
        <span class="note-title">Nothing posted yet — first notes coming soon</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note-excerpt">I'm setting this up before I start writing. Check back soon, or see the blog page for what's planned.</p>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
